        "reasoning": "Now I have an incredibly comprehensive understanding of all three projects. I've read the core source code of:\n\n1. **Low-code platform** - The DAG engine, flow execution, scheduling, caching, variable resolution, WebSocket pub/sub, SpEL expression engine, node registry\n2. **Drawing recognition** - The hybrid OCR/PDF pipeline, dimension parser, hole table parser, geometry associator, paddle detector, paddle OCR adapter, text layer extraction\n3. **Tianshu** - The complete outer/inner agent loop, sub-agent delegation, event system, evolution engine (online detector + offline miner + insight extractor + skill generator), tool executor with MCP support, workspace sandbox, system prompt caching, context compaction/summarization, doom loop detection\n\nLet me now compile the final comprehensive list of new patent titles.",
